# "Up to one target creature you control" - with no creature, the Device's trigger for its own entry has no target and still does the rest: with three Moxen already out it is the fourth artifact and
# "then transform this artifact" turns it into Geode Grotto (a land, no longer an artifact). On turn 3 a freshly cast Ornithopter does not trigger it any more, and the Grotto's {2}{R}, {T} ability is "only as a
# sorcery": refused in the beginning of combat step with everything untapped, accepted in the second main phase, giving the Ornithopter haste and +X/+0 for the four artifacts Bot1 controls (3 Moxen and itself).

